          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_14_equation_3.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{aligned} &\\text { Monte }=\\stackrel{\\text { }}{l}+\\left(\\frac{f_{1}-f_{0}}{2 f_{1}-f_{0}-f_{2}}\\right) \\times h\\\\ &\\quad \\stackrel{\\text { }}{=} 3+\\left(\\frac{8-7}{2 \\times 8-7-2}\\right) \\times 2=3+\\frac{2}{7}=3.286\\\\ \\end{aligned}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.274,
            0.556,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, the mode of the data above is 3.286."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.307,
            0.902,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 6 : The marks distribution of 30 students in a mathematics examination are given in Table 13.3 of Example 1. Find the mode of this data. Also compare and interpret the mode and the mean."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.375,
            0.901,
            0.416
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution : Refer to Table 13.3 of Example 1. Since the maximum number of students (i.e., 7) have got marks in the interval 40 - 55, the modal class is 40 - 55. Therefore,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.422,
            0.557,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "the lower limit (l) of the modal class = 40,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.448,
            0.373,
            0.467
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "the class size (h) = 15,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.474,
            0.52,
            0.494
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "the frequency "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( f _ { 1 } )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of modal class = 7,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.501,
            0.742,
            0.521
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "the frequency "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( f _ { 0 } )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of the class preceding the modal class = 3,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.527,
            0.756,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "the frequency "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( f _ { 2 } )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of the class succeeding the modal class = 6."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.553,
            0.331,
            0.572
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, using the formula:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.406,
            0.577,
            0.732,
            0.627
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_14_equation_13.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm{Model} = l + \\left( \\frac{f_1 - f_0}{2f_1 - f_0 - f_2} \\right) \\times h,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.654,
            0.172,
            0.671
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "we get"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.406,
            0.636,
            0.769,
            0.682
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_14_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm{Model} = 40 + \\left( \\frac{7 - 3}{14 - 6 - 3} \\right) \\times 15 = 52"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.691,
            0.348,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, the mode marks is 52."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.717,
            0.672,
            0.737
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, from Example 1, you know that the mean marks is 62."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.744,
            0.901,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, the maximum number of students obtained 52 marks, while on an average a student obtained 62 marks."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.789,
            0.218,
            0.807
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Remarks :"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.816,
            0.901,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. In Example 6, the mode is less than the mean. But for some other problems it may be equal or more than the mean also."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.862,
            0.902,
            0.902
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. It depends upon the demand of the situation whether we are interested in finding the average marks obtained by the students or the average of the marks obtained by most"
